spice
* SPICE Netlist for p-Channel Load Switch Circuit

* Voltage Source
V_in 8 0 DC 15V

* Resistors
R1 6 8 10k
R_L 222 0 5

* NMOS Transistor
M1 222 7 0 0 NMOS
RS1 7 0 1

* PMOS Transistor
M2 222 6 5 5 PMOS

* Control Voltage Source
V_EN 4 0 PULSE(0 5 1n)

* Connections
V_out 222 0

* Models
.model NMOS NMOS(Level=1)
.model PMOS PMOS(Level=1)

.end